\ The module-word half of the mutable-value-map image carry. The binding lives in a `use`d module,
\ so its body travels the image word table, and the map itself travels the mutable-value-map slot
\ table so every call to `(handlers)` reaches one live object. A handler registered at binary
\ runtime has to be visible through that same object.

use "./support/mutable_value_map_state.1z" ;

1 7 run-handler .
{ 2 3 } 7 run-handler .

9 [ 2 * ] register
9 21 run-handler .
